          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP 763 Geocacher Breakfast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were doing some Geocaching in the Cochrane area and stopped for this BCP before heading home. The area was quiet today and the cap was found quickly. After the flurry of capping the past couple of weeks most caps are nicely exposed. The numbers were nice and clear on this one. Thank you Outforthehunt.  (FOUND)&lt;/p&gt;

