          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP763 Geocacher Breakfast

N 51° 11.439 W 114° 27.507&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A nice quick grab once my GPSr zeroed out.  I think I got a few stares from passerby muggles while I was waiting for my waypoint average to finish.  The good news is at least they can't steal this cap and most likely after this weekend, activity here should probably settle down back to 'normal'.  TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
